                <div id="tab33" class="content">

                    <div class="faqquestionWrap mb30" data-rel="tab-c-1">
                        <div class="left">
                            <p class="faqHeading">Is there a minimum requirement of work experience required to apply?</p>

                            <img  src="https://images.mastersunion.link/uploads/25062025/v1/MainButton3.svg" class="toggler" alt="Icon">
                        </div>
                        <p class="faqanswer font-16 font-grey13" id="tab-c-1">While we generally recommend applicants have at least 3 years of full-time work experience in their family business, we also consider exceptional candidates with less experience. If you have a strong track record and can demonstrate your ability to benefit from and contribute to the programme, we may be able to accommodate you. In case any applicant has lesser work experience, feel free to reach out to the admissions team who will evaluate their profile and advise accordingly.
                        </p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faqquestionWrap mb30" data-rel="tab-c-2">
                        <div class="left">
                            <p class="faqHeading">Is there an age limit to entry?</p>

                            <img  src="https://images.mastersunion.link/uploads/25062025/v1/MainButton3.svg" class="toggler" alt="Icon">
                        </div>
                        <p class="faqanswer font-16 font-grey13" id="tab-c-2">There is no age limit for entry. However, the programme is more suitable for candidates with experience of 3 years or more. If they have less work experience, we encourage them to get in touch with the admissions team who will evaluate their profile and advise them accordingly.</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="faqquestionWrap mb30" data-rel="tab-c-3">
                        <div class="left">
                            <p class="faqHeading">Who are we looking for?</p>

                            <img  src="https://images.mastersunion.link/uploads/25062025/v1/MainButton3.svg" class="toggler" alt="Icon">
                        </div>
                        <p class="faqanswer font-16 font-grey13" id="tab-c-3">We're searching for individuals who possess the leadership potential to take their family business to new heights. If you're a motivated self-starter who can identify and capitalise on opportunities, we encourage you to apply.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                


                </div>
                <div id="tab44" class="content">
                    <div class="faqquestionWrap mb30" data-rel="tab-d-1">
                        <div class="left">
                            <p class="faqHeading">Do we need to write a GMAT, GRE, or CAT to enrol in this programme?</p>

                            <img  src="https://images.mastersunion.link/uploads/25062025/v1/MainButton3.svg" class="toggler" alt="Icon">
                        </div>
                        <p class="faqanswer font-16 font-grey13" id="tab-d-1">No, this programme doesn’t require any test scores.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faqquestionWrap mb30" data-rel="tab-d-2">
                        <div class="left">
                            <p class="faqHeading">Are all candidates interviewed?</p>

                            <img  src="https://images.mastersunion.link/uploads/25062025/v1/MainButton3.svg" class="toggler" alt="Icon">
                        </div>
                        <p class="faqanswer font-16 font-grey13" id="tab-d-2">Post the application process, the shortlisted candidates are invited to an online interview with our admissions panel.
                            {{!-- <b>Note:</b> Accepted applicants get an exclusive Discord access! Join events, connect with
                            peers, and experience Masters’ Union culture firsthand! --}}
                        </p>


                    </div>
                    <div class="faqquestionWrap mb30" data-rel="tab-d-3">
                        <div class="left">
                            <p class="faqHeading">Can applicants get their profile evaluated?</p>

                            <img  src="https://images.mastersunion.link/uploads/25062025/v1/MainButton3.svg" class="toggler" alt="Icon">
                        </div>
                        <p class="faqanswer font-16 font-grey13" id="tab-d-3">Applicants are welcome to schedule a 1:1 session with our counsellors to discuss fitment with the programme based on their profile.</p>

                    </div>

                  



                </div>
                <div id="tab55" class="content">

                    <div class="faqquestionWrap mb30" data-rel="tab-e-1">
                        <div class="left">
                            <p class="faqHeading">What is included in the cost of the programme? </p>

                            <img  src="https://images.mastersunion.link/uploads/25062025/v1/MainButton3.svg" class="toggler" alt="Icon">
                        </div>
                        <p class="faqanswer font-16 font-grey13" id="tab-e-1">The programme does not cover airfare or visa costs. It will however cover boarding, lodging and local travel during immersions. For outstation students, hotel accommodation during on-campus immersions will not be covered.</p>
                    </div>
                    <div class="faqquestionWrap mb30" data-rel="tab-e-2">
                        <div class="left">
                            <p class="faqHeading">Are the fees refunded in case applicants decide to drop out of the programme?

                            </p>

                            <img  src="https://images.mastersunion.link/uploads/25062025/v1/MainButton3.svg" class="toggler" alt="Icon">
                        </div>
                        <p class="faqanswer font-16 font-grey13" id="tab-e-2">Fees once submitted are not eligible for refunds. Masters’ Union reserves the right to amend this Refund Policy at any time without prior notice.

                        </p>
